of this Section and the associated plans.  The following individuals must attend this meeting: [Contractor's 
project manager,][ site foreman,][ and Contracting Officer].<BRK/>
<BRK/>
Record <SUB>pre-construction meeting minutes</SUB> and publish via email within 48 hours to the attendees.  Re-publish the 
